[[File:TheArmorer-SWEDK.png|thumb|250px|right|The Armorer wielded a beskar hammer.]]
{{Quote|I remember the forge well. It was large and ornate and the air rang with the music of a hundred hammers. And here stood a simple one. Yet, they were both forges.|[[The Armorer]] comparing the [[Great Forge]] to her [[Armorer's workshop|workshop]]|<ref name="Pirate">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 21: The Pirate}}</ref>}}
A '''hammer''' was a type of tool. [[Jedi Master]] [[Luke Skywalker]] insulted the [[Knights of Ren]] when [[Mission to Elphrona|fighting]] them on [[Elphrona]], referring to them that they used the [[dark side of the Force]] clumsily, like a hammer while he, using the [[light side of the Force]] used it like a blade.<ref name="TRoKR 2">[[The Rise of Kylo Ren 2|''The Rise of Kylo Ren'' 2]]</ref>

